== Notes ==
*Requires [[Hordes of the Underdark]].
* The bonus hit points are not retroactive, nor do they extend into [[epic class]] levels; this feat gives an extra 3 hit points at each pale master level from 5 to 10.
*Epic pale masters (level 11+) get 5 bonus hit points every 5 levels (at 15, 20, 25, and 30).